Support a separate public-header installation directory on Unix.

Let header install/uninstall rules and generated consumer metadata use the
same Configure option. Keep the existing include directory as the default;
source-tree include paths remain unchanged. Both relative and absolute
installation directories retain DESTDIR support.

TODO: propose this option upstream. This first patch covers Unix Makefiles;
Windows/VMS installation rules need corresponding support before proposing
it as a cross-platform option.

