--- a/INSTALL.md
+++ b/INSTALL.md
@@ -337,6 +337,15 @@
 
 Directories
 -----------
+
+### includedir
+
+    --includedir=DIR
+
+Directory for public headers when using the Unix Makefile build system.
+Relative paths are interpreted relative to `--prefix`; absolute paths are
+used as given. The default is `include`. The generated pkg-config and CMake
+files describe this directory as well.
 
